# Description
- Creating MultiSelect component with search and lazy loading
- Adding tests and storybook examples

# Code Example

```
<MultipleSelect
          items={flagsData}
          onChange={(items) => console.log(items)}
          renderItem={({ name }) => name}
          renderSelected={(selectedItems) => (
              <span>{selectedItems.length} selected flags</span>
          )}
          value={[flagsData[0], flagsData[1]]}
          resourceName="flags"
          onLoadMore={() => console.log('Load more!')}
        />
```

